OL,3,ARussell Brand appears in court for
OL,4,Astart of rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand pleaded not guilty to the charges
OL,7,Fduring pre-trial hearings.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
